flowchart TD
  Start([Log-Datei verfügbar]) --> Select[Datei wählen<br/>blf / mf4 / asc / log]
  Select --> GFmt{Format?}
  GFmt -->|BLF| Blf[BLF Decoder]
  GFmt -->|MF4| Mf4[MF4 Decoder]
  GFmt -->|ASC| Asc[ASC Parser]
  GFmt -->|Text| Txt[Text/Candump]
  Blf --> Frames[Frames normalisieren]
  Mf4 --> Frames
  Asc --> Frames
  Txt --> Frames
  Frames --> Flow[CAN Flow Analyzer]
  Flow --> GDbc{DBC?}
  GDbc -->|ja| Dbc[DBC Annotation]
  GDbc -->|nein| Report
  Dbc --> Report[JSON Report + Audit]
  Report --> End([Report bereit])
